gles labeled 'Consumers' represents multiple consumer entities.  Two arrows=
 connect the Brokers to the Consumers.  The top arrow, labeled 'b1. subscri=
be', indicates that Consumers subscribe to topics or queues within the Brok=
ers. The bottom arrow, labeled 'b2. consume', shows Consumers retrieving me=
