 broker.</p>
<h3 id=3D"state-storage">State storage</h3>
<p>In the message queue broker, the state storage stores:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>The mapping between partitions and consumers.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The last consumed offsets of consumer groups for each partition. As show=
n in Figure 21, the last consumed offset for consumer group 1 is 6 and the =
offset for consumer group 2 is 13.</p>
</li>
</ul>
