content: center;"><figcaption class=3D"py-1">Figure 26 ack=3D1</figcaption>=
</div></figure>
<p><strong>ACK=3D0</strong></p>
<p>The producer keeps sending messages to the leader without waiting for an=
y acknowledgment, and it never retries. This method provides the lowest lat=
ency at the cost of potential message loss. This setting might be good for =
use cases like collecting metrics or logging data since data volume is high=
 and occasional data loss is acceptable.</p>
